    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 2, SJ 1",
        "text": "Fraser Minten opened the scoring at 12:55, beating Yaroslav Askarov from the right circle after Casey Mittelstadt retrieved his own rebound behind the net. Jacob Trouba one-timed a Kiefer Sherwood pass to tie it 1–1 at 15:29, just after a San Jose power play expired. Charlie McAvoy, back from a six-game suspension, crashed the net and tapped in a JJ Peterka feed at 18:43 for a 2–1 lead."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "BOS 4, SJ 2",
        "text": "Ivar Stenberg, the No. 2 pick in the 2026 draft, scored his first NHL goal on a power play at 5:48, set up by Macklin Celebrini, to tie it 2–2. Matthew Poitras jammed a loose puck past Askarov at 8:42 for a 3–2 lead, and Pavel Zacha finished a 2-on-1 from Morgan Geekie at 19:57 for a 4–2 cushion."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: BOS 6, SJ 3",
        "text": "Celebrini one-timed a power-play goal at 5:04 to cut it to 4–3. Minten restored the two-goal lead at 11:47, tapping in Marat Khusnutdinov's feed at the top of the crease for 5–3, and Will Borgen banked an empty-netter off the boards from his own zone at 18:18. Darnell Nurse left in the period after fighting Nikita Zadorov."
      }
    ],
